<title>THAILAND: BADMINTON-THAI OPEN FINALS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-THAI OPEN FINALS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of singles finals in the</p>
<p>Thai Open badminton tournament at the weekend (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men</p>
<p>2-Dong Jiong (China) beat 1-Joko Suprianto (Indonesia) 15-13</p>
<p>15-7</p>
<p>Women</p>
<p>3-Wang Chen (China) beat 4-Kim Ji-hyun (South Korea) 2-11 11-5</p>
<p>11-7</p>
</text>
